# Short 4, "The Space page" (vertical, tools/film.py --layout vertical): Basic playing, FX for the Space page, and
# its four knobs one at a time, each turn slow (single steps, 50 ms apart) from a bar's downbeat: Echo taken
# dry, Reverb up into the plate (heard best with the echo out of the way) and back, Echo up past the
# recipe, Echo time through 1/4 and 1/2 and back to 1/8., Feedback past 100% (it swells) and back.
# Each `bar` prints the film's time there (the cue sheet for the labels).
bar 8
wav 13-short-space.wav
film 13-short-space.film
bar 8 BASIC playing (F Dorian, 122)
bar 10 FX: the Space page
tap FX
bar 11 KNOB 1, Echo 55 down to 0: dry
turn K1 -55 50
expect par8 0
bar 13 KNOB 4, Reverb 35 up to 100: into the plate
turn K4 65 50
expect par10 100
bar 15 Reverb back to 40
turn K4 -60 50
expect par10 40
bar 17 KNOB 1 again, Echo 0 up to 75: wet
turn K1 75 50
expect par8 75
bar 19 KNOB 2, Echo time 1/8. to 1/4
turn K2 1 150
expect par9 2
bar 21 Echo time 1/2
turn K2 2 150
expect par9 4
bar 23 Echo time back to 1/8.
turn K2 -3 150
expect par9 1
bar 24 KNOB 3, Feedback 85% up to 112%: it swells
turn K3 40 50
expect par11 100
bar 27 Feedback back to 85%
turn K3 -40 50
expect par11 60
bar 32 END
filmstop
wavstop
